              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "انگوٹھی (angūṭhī) is a tadbhava, a word inherited and reshaped by sound change. It comes from aṅguṣṭhiya, \"of the thumb\", a form CDIAL reconstructs from its descendants (CDIAL 138). It is built on aṅguṣṭha, \"thumb\"."
